{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "024shk_401_2_4_024_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e891192ec7d341f86bc9551a717a6aff3ab338569c81dfb987c47d5e41af7d51",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:024shk_401_2_4_024_01_09_a:2_4_024_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05efed428759ec36a53294cfc027dc768e8ccc5257a065dbf5700b12c6756718",
      "text": "……啊，●●●●プロデューサー酱？\n早上好！快听我说听我说！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_401_2_4_024_01_09_a:2_4_024_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c4e945845094e516a5d016c2c2e3c2664cac9d12c12436a068cccdeb8ec3648",
      "text": "昨天晚上我梦到音乐节了哦。\n315 Production的大家也全都出场了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_401_2_4_024_01_09_a:2_4_024_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ebddfa0960afc9e72dce8b6edb365aa926273063cbfede056793d1f802660ff",
      "text": "连在梦里都在和大家尽情高歌，\n简直太棒啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_401_2_4_024_01_09_a:2_4_024_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bb1f922bb51d66781b430c2b0e284b443c94f35cbd5f5afc235200da02d78ef",
      "text": "这正说明之前的音乐节\n超级无敌开心啊☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_401_2_4_024_01_09_a:2_4_024_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de3c413d0608c55223d22cf9c4c3a3cfffd84a98d809542e136985c3c8b95fb5",
      "text": "下次再去参加音乐节的时候，\n要更加更加嗨起来才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_401_2_4_024_01_09_a:2_4_024_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df8eeec3127be4d68b3dd373131a7d670a12d65bd9a1cca57f67ca72a4e1f075",
      "text": "呜～……说着说着\n总觉得好想唱歌了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_401_2_4_024_01_09_a:2_4_024_01_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11d54e28738e062287a4af585bcced75989dfdd3a487c94eb65501364ec494bf",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱，\n能拜托你帮忙预约一下练习室吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_401_2_4_024_01_09_a:2_4_024_01_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34",
      "text": "明白了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_401_2_4_024_01_09_a:2_4_024_01_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed89b555abc9e7443dd34c9dd87cde789a3e2341e10ab20055dcd75eb0afa2dd",
      "text": "真的吗！？太感谢啦！\n我也去问问隼人亲他们要不要来好～了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_401_2_4_024_01_09_a:2_4_024_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c881ffde974737be14a3123210bb855275a344ad74333a04f956425f28ff94c",
      "text": "那么，●●●●プロデューサー酱。\n今天也请多关照啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
